# Search profile

## Profile
- Relevant experience and outcomes, with evidence you can substantiate
- Portfolio material available to share and what is actually on the CV

## Target
- Role families and the work you want to own
- Adjacent roles and work you would consider
- Work or sectors you want to exclude

## Constraints
- Location, remote or hybrid requirements, work authorisation and start date
- Compensation, working hours, seniority and other hard limits
- Preferred age of a posting (the default is 35 days)

## Search sources
- Employer careers pages, ATS boards and other sources worth checking
- Previously submitted or dismissed roles to avoid resurfacing
